      "writtenOn": "2022-06-29T02:46:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you add:\nTODO(b/237449433): Fix ESPI init and callback setup\n\nThe wider problem we have here is that splitting the ESPI init and config for the shim and pwrseq code will possibly caused missed events and signals, since the shim inits/configures the ESPI driver, and the pwrseq driver registers callbacks after this.",
      "revId": "e1f27a5a35291c2fc06c42f0648c2bc4593d006d",
